on a phone: is it clear what to tap first, and how to feed your new pet? If something gets in your way, please tell us the step and your browser. For transparency, development uses AI-assisted code, procedural 3D asset scripts and text. Thanks for trying it! Alex \/ PingBlip","interactionStatistic":{"interactionType":"http:\/\/schema.org\/CommentAction","@type":"InteractionCounter","userInteractionCount":1},"author":{"@type":"Person","url":"\/profile\/pingblip","name":"PingBlip"},"@context":"http:\/\/schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","@id":"https:\/\/itch.io\/t\/7175888\/pingblip-hatch-a-pet-from-real-weather-free-browser-game"}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"itemListElement":[{"position":1,"@type":"ListItem","item":{"name":"itch.io Community","@id":"https:\/\/itch.io\/community"}},{"position":2,"@type":"ListItem","item":{"name":"General","@id":"https:\/\/itch.io\/board\/10014\/general"}},{"position":3,"@type":"ListItem","item":{"name":"Release Announcements","@id":"https:\/\/itch.io\/board\/10022\/release-announcements"}}],"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@context":"http:\/\/schema.org"}</script><meta content="Hi everyone! We are sharing PingBlip , our free browser creature collector, now playable on itch.io. Real weather helps decide what hatches. Feed your pet with live sensor readings and discover a coll" property="og:description"/><meta content="Hi everyone! We are sharing PingBlip , our free browser creature collector, now playable on itch.io. Real weather helps decide what hatches. Feed your pet with live sensor readings and discover a coll" name="description"/><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/><meta content="#FA5C5C" name="theme-color"/><link href="https://static.itch.io/main.css?1794249661" rel="stylesheet"/><script type="text/javascript">if (!window.location.hostname.match(/localhost/)) {      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
