="/community">itch.io Community</a> » <a href="/board/10014/general">General</a> » <a href="/board/10022/release-announcements">Release Announcements</a></div><div class="stat_header_widget"><div data-p="{&quot;post_id&quot;:17655785,&quot;score&quot;:0}" class="community_topic_voter_widget"><button type="button" class="vote_up_btn vote_btn icon-caret-up button small outline"></button><div class="vote_score">0</div><button type="button" class="vote_down_btn vote_btn icon-caret-down button small outline"></button></div><a href="https://pingblip.itch.io/pingblip" class="topic_game_link"><div style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwODg4NDkxLmpwZw==/150x120%23/7M5rGl.jpg)" class="topic_game_cover"></div></a><div class="text_container"><h1>PingBlip — hatch a pet from real weather (free browser game)<span class="topic_flags">  </span></h1><div class="topic_meta"><span class="topic_date">A topic by <a href="/profile/pingblip">PingBlip</a> created <abbr title="20 October 2026 @ 07:57 UTC"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-stopwatch"></span> 20 days ago</abbr></span> <span class="views_count">Views: 28</span></div></div></div><div class="sub_header"><div class="topic_pager "><span class="page_label">Viewing posts <nobr><span>1</span> to <span>1</span></nobr></span></div></div></div><div class="padded"><div id="community_post_list_8086840" class="community_post_list_widget base_widget"><div data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:17655785,&quot;user_id&quot;:19649725}" id="post-17655785" class="community_post sidebar_avatar"><div id="first-post" class="post_anchor"></div><div id="last-post" class="post_anchor"></div><div class="post_grid"><a href="/profile/pingblip" class="avatar_container"><div style="background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwODg4MTI0LnBuZw==/80x80%23/uu1dpK.png)" class="post_avatar"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="/profile/pingblip">PingBlip</a></span><span title="2026-10-20 07:57:58" class="post_date"><a href="/t/7175888/pingblip-hatch-a-pet-from-real-weather-free-browser-game">20 days ago</a></span></div><div class="post_content"><div dir="auto" class="post_body user_formatted"><p></p><p>Hi everyone! We are sharing <strong>PingBlip</strong>, our free browser creature collector, now playable on itch.io.</p><p>Real weather helps decide what hatches. Feed your pet with live sensor readings and discover a collection of 80 odd little creatures, including Worm CEO and Chonk Capy. When you are away, your pet falls asleep; it never dies.</p><p><a href="https://pingblip.itch.io/pingblip">Play PingBlip on itch.io</a> &mdash; no sign-up or download. It works on phones and computers.</p><p><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNTE1ODc4NC8zMDg4ODUzMC5wbmc=/original/ZKPXPZ.png" alt="PingBlip game screenshot" loading="lazy"></p><p>We just simplified the first-pet flow and would love feedback from people trying it on a phone: is it clear what to tap first, and how to feed your new pet? If something gets in your way, please tell us the step and your browser.</p><p>For transparency, development uses AI-assisted code, procedural 3D asset scripts and text.</p><p>Thanks for trying it!<br>Alex / PingBlip</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Ft%2F7175888%2Fpingblip-hatch-a-pet-from-real-weather-free-browser-game&amp;intent=community" data-register_action="community_reply" class="post_action reply_btn">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><script id="vote_counts_tpl" type="text/template"><% if (up_score > 0) { %><span class="upvotes">(+{{up_score}})</span><% } %><% if (down_score > 0) { %><span class="downvotes">(-{{down_score}})</span><% } %></script></div></div><div class="topic_posts_footer"><div class="create_account_banner"><a href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Ft%2F7175888%2Fpingblip-hatch-a-pet-from-real-weather-free-browser-game&amp;intent=community" data-register_action="community_reply" class="button">Log in to reply</a> Join the discussion. Log in or create a free itch.io account to continue.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="footer"><div class="primary"><div class="social"><a href="https://twitter.com/itchio"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-twitter"></span><span class="screenreader_only">itch.io on Twitter</span></a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/itchiogames"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-facebook"></span><span class="screenreader_only">itch.io on Facebook</span></a></div><a href="/docs/general/about">About</a><a href="/docs/general/faq">FAQ</a><a href="/blog">Blog</a><a href="/support">Contact us</a></div><div class="secondary"><span class="copyright">Copyright © 2026 itch corp</span><span class="spacer"> · </span><a href="/directory">Directory</a><span class="spacer"> · </span><a href="/docs/legal/terms" rel="nofollow">Terms</a><span class="spacer"> · </span><a href="/docs/legal/privacy-policy" rel="nofollow">Privacy</a><span class="spacer"> · </span><a href="/docs/legal/cookie-policy" rel="nofollow">Cookies</a></div></div><script id="loading_lightbox_tpl" type="text/template"><div aria-live="polite" class="lightbox loading_lightbox"><div class="loader_outer"><div class="loader_label">Loading</div><div class="loader_bar"><div class="loader_bar_slider"></div></div></div></div></script><script type="text/javascript">new I.CommunityTopicHeader('#community_topic_header_5544569', {"moderation":{"urls":{"stick_topic":"\/topic\/:topic_id\/stick","lock_topic":"\/topic\/:topic_id\/lock","archive_topic":"\/topic\/:topic_id\/archive","delete_topic":"\/topic\/:topic_id\/delete"}},"vote_url":"\/vote\/post\/{{ post_id }}"});new I.CommunityViewTopic('#community_topic_posts_3583856', {"report_url":"\/post\/:post_id\/report"});init_Header('#header_3745510', {"autocomplete_props":{"search_url":"\/search","i18n":{"search_placeholder":"Search for games, jams, tags or creators","search":"Search"},"ca_source":25,"ca_types":{"bundle":6,"jam":4,"featured_tag